# media/windows/hittest.cmds — what the window answers when Windows asks where the pointer is
# (WM_NCHITTEST), which decides whether a press clicks what's under it or starts a window drag; and
# real clicks (the move, press and release a mouse sends) on the title bar and the sidebar. Windows
# only. Every answer is written to hittest.txt; a wrong one fails its line.
# Run: pwsh script/capture.ps1 windows/hittest     (SIZE=1280x820; the DPI is the display's)

pace 0
theme night
glass off
project @REPO@
send hello
wait idle 30000
elements

# The Agents title bar: each control takes its own press...
hittest toggle-sidebar HTCLIENT
hittest mode-agents HTCLIENT
hittest mode-editor HTCLIENT
hittest run-actions HTCLIENT
hittest open-in HTCLIENT
hittest pop-out HTCLIENT
hittest toggle-tools HTCLIENT
hittest settle HTCLIENT
# ...the title, the project beside it and the empty strip are the window's handle (a press there moves
# the window and a double click maximises it), and the caption buttons answer their own codes.
hittest title-text HTCAPTION
hittest title-project HTCAPTION
hittest 800 17 HTCAPTION
hittest -17 17 HTCLOSE
hittest -51 17 HTMAXBUTTON
hittest -85 17 HTMINBUTTON
# Under the title bar everything is the window's own.
hittest 100 400 HTCLIENT
hittest 800 400 HTCLIENT

# A real click on the Editor toggle switches to the Editor, and back.
realclick mode-editor
wait 700
hittest command-center HTCLIENT
hittest toggle-primary HTCLIENT
hittest toggle-panel HTCLIENT
hittest toggle-ai HTCLIENT
hittest ide-settings HTCLIENT
hittest mode-switch HTCLIENT
# Between the switch and the Command Center is the Editor's empty strip.
hittest 490 17 HTCAPTION
hittest 800 17 HTCLIENT
hittest -17 17 HTCLOSE
shot hit-editor
realclick mode-agents
wait 700
hittest settle HTCLIENT

# Real clicks in the sidebar: the nav rows, New thread, and the thread's own row and its project's header
# (a thread's id starts 01 as every id made now does: `live-line-01*` is the one element whose id starts so).
realclick open-basecamp
wait 500
realclick open-notes
wait 500
realclick new-thread
wait 500
realclick live-line-01*
wait 700
hittest settle HTCLIENT
realclick live-proj-head-01*
wait 500
shot hit-sidebar
